    "show_share": true,
    "description": "On 27 February 2018, Nursing Now held launch activities worldwide. However, the main launch happened in London and was attended by Professor Sharon Brownie (Dean of the Aga Khan University's School of Nursing and Midwifery East Africa [SONAM - EA]) among other high-profile guests.",
